### Requisições de exemplo (extensão "REST Client" do VS Code ou HTTP Client do GoLand)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz

### Readiness (verifica o banco)
GET {{baseUrl}}/readyz

### Criar pedido
# @name createOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": "customer-1",
  "items": [
    { "sku": "KB-001", "quantity": 2, "unit_price_cents": 15000 },
    { "sku": "MS-002", "quantity": 1, "unit_price_cents": 8990 }
  ]
}

### Buscar pedido
@orderId = {{createOrder.response.body.id}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}

### Listar pedidos (filtros opcionais: status, limit, offset)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?status=CREATED&limit=10

### Mudar status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "PAID" }

### Transição inválida (espera 409)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "DELIVERED" }

### Histórico de status
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/history
